00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:43,500
Christmas with a Prince is a drama, romance, tv
movie film directed by Justin G. Dyck.

2
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:21,000
Pediatric specialist Tasha Mason is focused on one thing; keeping the
kids in her ward as healthy and happy as possible.

3
00:16:52,500 --> 00:16:58,500
So when her high-school crush, who just happens to be handsome Prince Alexander Cavalieri, breaks his leg on a nearby ski-slope, Tasha is forced to allow him
to secretly get well on her floor and she’s furious that a spoiled Royal is interrupting the precious healing time her kids so badly need.

4
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:36,000
Soon, however, Tasha learns that some tough love and a lot of Christmas
spirit, could turn this royal pain into a knight in shining armor.

